      "steps": [
        {
          "key": "open-create",
          "title": "Open the storage account wizard",
          "instruction": "Select **Storage accounts**, then **Create**.",
          "explanation": "The wizard contains Basics, Advanced, Networking, Data protection, and Review + create.",
          "targetId": "storage-create",
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "visited",
              "description": "Create storage account is open",
              "rule": {
                "type": "visited",
                "page": "storage-create"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "create-account",
          "title": "Create a secure read-access geo-redundant account",
          "instruction": "Use **rg-data-prod**, storage account name `northwindinv2026`, **(Europe) West Europe**, **Primary service** **Azure Blob Storage**, **Performance** **Standard**, and **Redundancy** **Read-access geo-redundant storage (RA-GRS)** or **Read-access geo-zone-redundant storage (RA-GZRS)**. On **Advanced**, require secure transfer, turn off anonymous blob access, and set **Minimum TLS version** **TLS 1.2**. On **Data protection**, enable soft delete for blobs and containers, then **Review + create** and **Create**.",
          "explanation": "Read-access geo-redundant options meet the outage-read requirement.",
          "targetId": "storage-wizard",
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "account",
              "description": "The account has the required secure settings",
              "rule": {
                "type": "arrayContains",
                "path": "storageAccounts",
                "match": {
                  "name": "northwindinv2026",
                  "resourceGroup": "rg-data-prod",
                  "redundancy": "RA-GRS",
                  "secureTransfer": true,
                  "anonymousBlobAccess": false,
                  "minimumTls": "TLS 1.2",
                  "blobSoftDelete": true,
                  "containerSoftDelete": true
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "container",
          "title": "Create the private invoices container",
          "instruction": "Open **Data storage > Containers**, select **+ Container**, set **Name** `invoices`, set **Anonymous access level** **Private (no anonymous access)**, and select **Create**.",
          "explanation": "Private containers prevent unauthenticated reads of invoice blobs.",
          "targetId": "new-container",
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "private",
              "description": "invoices is private",
              "rule": {
                "type": "arrayContains",
                "path": "containers",
                "match": {
                  "account": "northwindinv2026",
                  "name": "invoices",
                  "publicAccess": "Private (no anonymous access)"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "upload",
          "title": "Upload the invoice",
          "instruction": "In **invoices**, select **Upload**, choose **invoice-2026-09.pdf**, keep **Blob type** **Block blob**, and select **Upload**.",
          "explanation": "Block blobs are appropriate for documents such as PDFs.",
          "targetId": "upload-blob",
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "blob",
              "description": "invoice-2026-09.pdf is uploaded",
              "rule": {
                "type": "arrayContains",
                "path": "blobs",
                "match": {
                  "account": "northwindinv2026",
                  "container": "invoices",
                  "name": "invoice-2026-09.pdf",
                  "contentType": "application/pdf"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "tier",
          "title": "Change the blob access tier",
          "instruction": "Select **invoice-2026-09.pdf**, choose **Cool** or **Archive** in **Change access tier**, and select **Save**.",
          "explanation": "Archive has rehydration latency; Cool is easier to retrieve.",
          "targetId": "tier-form",
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "cool",
              "description": "The invoice is in Cool or Archive",
              "rule": {
                "type": "anyOf",
                "rules": [
                  {
                    "type": "arrayContains",
                    "path": "blobs",
                    "match": {
                      "name": "invoice-2026-09.pdf",
                      "accessTier": "Cool"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "arrayContains",
                    "path": "blobs",
                    "match": {
                      "name": "invoice-2026-09.pdf",
                      "accessTier": "Archive"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "finalRules": [
        {
          "key": "private-secure",
          "description": "Anonymous access is disabled and the container is private",
          "rule": {
            "type": "allOf",
            "rules": [
              {
                "type": "arrayContains",
                "path": "storageAccounts",
                "match": {
                  "name": "northwindinv2026",
                  "anonymousBlobAccess": false,
                  "secureTransfer": true,
                  "minimumTls": "TLS 1.2"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "arrayContains",
                "path": "containers",
                "match": {
                  "name": "invoices",
                  "publicAccess": "Private (no anonymous access)"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "failureFeedback": "Keep anonymous access disabled and the container private."
        },
        {
          "key": "redundancy",
          "description": "Redundancy satisfies read access to secondary region",
          "rule": {
            "type": "arrayContains",
            "path": "storageAccounts",
            "match": {
              "name": "northwindinv2026",
              "redundancy": "RA-GRS"
            }
          },
          "failureFeedback": "Choose RA-GRS or RA-GZRS."
        }
      ],
      "solution": "1. Select **Storage accounts** > **Create**.\n2. In **Basics**, use **rg-data-prod**, name `northwindinv2026`, **Azure Blob Storage**, **Standard**, and **Read-access geo-redundant storage (RA-GRS)**.\n3. In **Advanced**, require secure transfer, turn off anonymous blob access, and set **Minimum TLS version** to **TLS 1.2**.\n4. In **Data protection**, enable soft delete for blobs and containers, then **Review + create** > **Create**.\n5. Open **Containers** > **+ Container**, create `invoices`, and keep **Private (no anonymous access)**.\n6. Open `invoices`, select **Upload**, choose `invoice-2026-09.pdf`, keep **Block blob**, and **Upload**.\n7. Select the blob, change **Access tier** to **Cool** or **Archive**, then **Save**."
    }
